-- **1 (delta-0 activate was a NO-OP — palette+scale unreachable on touch):** `adjust_step` normalizes delta 0 → +1 at the adjust site (touch tap / mouse row-click / Enter / pad A all advance the cycle rows); explicit +/- pass through. Pinned by `settings_adjust_step_normalizes` + the composed cycle tests (13 settings tests).
